==================================================

After the hero, create a calm trust section.

Headline:

Trusted by teams building what's next

Show fictional company wordmarks.

Use monochrome or muted gray.

Avoid flashy logos.

Use plenty of whitespace.

==================================================
10. PROBLEM SECTION
==================================================

Create a visually editorial section.

Headline:

Your team shouldn't spend hours managing work.

Three problems:

Too many tools

Repetitive manual work

Work gets lost between teams

Use clean white cards.

Each card should have a small visual or product-inspired illustration.

Avoid generic icons.

Add a subtle ambient gradient orb behind this section.

==================================================
11. AI AUTOMATION SECTION
==================================================

This is where the AI capability should become visible.

Headline:

Turn repetitive work into automated workflows.

Show a beautiful horizontal workflow:

Customer request
→
AI understands
→
Task created
→
Team assigned
→
Completed

Use clean connected lines.

Use indigo only for the AI step.

Use teal for completed state.

Put a very subtle soft-blue gradient orb behind the workflow.

This section should visually explain the AI value rather than simply saying “AI-powered”.

==================================================
12. PRODUCT SHOWCASE
==================================================

Create a large realistic FlowAI workspace dashboard.

Use:

Projects
Tasks
Automations
AI Assistant
Team

Use white surfaces and subtle gray borders.

Show realistic project progress.

Use minimal accent colors.

Place the dashboard on top of a very soft atmospheric gradient background.

==================================================
