==================================================

Create four premium feature cards:

AI Workflows

Smart Workspace

Team Intelligence

Powerful Automations

Cards should be mostly white.

Use subtle borders and soft shadows.

Add tiny product UI previews instead of generic icons.

Use soft background orbs behind selected cards.

==================================================
14. AI ASSISTANT
==================================================

Create an AI assistant section but keep it human and product-focused.

Headline:

Ask your workspace anything.

Show:

User:
“What’s blocking the product launch?”

FlowAI:

“Three tasks are currently blocking the launch. Two are waiting for design approval and one is assigned to engineering.”

Show action buttons:

Show blockers
Create follow-up
Assign task

Keep this section clean.

Do not use glowing AI effects.

==================================================
