==================================================

Create:

Built for teams that move fast.

Marketing

Operations

Product

Use large editorial cards.

Each card should have subtle ambient background color.

==================================================
16. FINAL CTA
==================================================

Create a darker final CTA section for contrast.

Background:

#111827

Headline:

Give your team back their time.

Supporting text:

See how FlowAI can help your team organize work, automate repetitive tasks and move faster.

CTA:

Book a Demo →

Behind the CTA, use extremely subtle indigo/blue blurred gradient orbs.

