==================================================
17. DESIGN LANGUAGE
==================================================

The entire page should feel like ONE cohesive design system.

Use:

Large typography
Generous whitespace
Soft atmospheric background shapes
Clean product UI
Editorial composition
Subtle shadows
Rounded cards
Minimal borders
Controlled accent colors

Avoid visual noise.

Every decorative element must support hierarchy.

