Reduce the ambient gradient orbs on mobile.

Keep them extremely subtle so they don't interfere with readability.

==================================================
FINAL DESIGN GOAL
==================================================

The finished website should NOT immediately look like:

“Another AI startup website.”

Instead, it should feel like:

“A premium productivity platform that happens to have powerful AI.”

The AI should be communicated through the PRODUCT EXPERIENCE, automation workflow and messaging.

The visual identity should be driven by:

Typography
Whitespace
Soft ambient gradient orbs
Clean product interfaces
Editorial composition
Premium SaaS aesthetics

The final result should feel sophisticated enough for a real B2B software company and strong enough for a Digital Experience Designer portfolio challenge.